<%# VS scoreboard — Hoojah 2026 (redesign Phase 3, Task 3.4), mockup ~1088-1109. Renders
    for the ACTIVE/CONCLUDED transcript only (`_debate_pending`, Phase 3.3, already owns
    the dedicated pending layout) — `debates/show.html.erb`'s non-pending branch renders
    this ALONGSIDE the existing `_debate_status`/`_debate_actions` card, not instead of
    it: this partial carries no pinned dom_id of its own, because nothing broadcasts to
    it directly. Every value here is DERIVED (`current_round`/`current_phase`/
    `rounds_limit`), so the existing `:status`/`:actions` Turbo-Stream replaces already
    keep the page correct on every transition — this card simply re-reads the same
    derived methods on its own next render.

    Locals: debate. VIEWER-AGNOSTIC — no `viewer` local, no `current_user` — so it stays
    safe to render from a broadcast context even though nothing does yet.

    The round/phase row and the Live pill are gated on `debate.active?`, the same guard
    `_debate_status` already uses for its own round counter and for the identical reason
    (`current_round`/`current_phase` go stale — or nil — the moment a debate concludes;
    see that partial's own comment). A concluded debate therefore renders only the
    avatar trio + "VS", with no round line and no Live pill.

    Challenger/opponent take the agree/disagree convention `_debate_pending` (Phase 3.3)
    already established for this trio (its headline colours the two handles the same
    way) — this is NOT the claim-vote stance colouring `IconsHelper#stance_color` /
    `Hujah::STANCES` mean elsewhere. Here the two colours simply tell the two SIDES of
    a debate apart, the same override `_debate_turn`'s bubble label makes below. %>
<%= render layout: "ui/card", locals: {padded: true, class: "debate-scoreboard flex flex-col gap-3"} do %>
  <% if debate.active? %>
    <div class="flex justify-end">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase text-white bg-disagree px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white block" style="animation: hbreathe 1.4s ease-in-out infinite"></span>
        Live
      </span>
    </div>
  <% end %>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3.5">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 flex-1 min-w-0">
      <%= render "ui/avatar", user: debate.challenger, size: :md, variant: :tile %>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-ink truncate">@<%= debate.challenger.username %></span>
      <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-agree">Challenger</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 shrink-0">
      <% if debate.active? %>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-faint">Round <%= debate.current_round %> of <%= debate.rounds_limit %></span>
      <% end %>
      <span class="text-2xl font-black text-ink">VS</span>
      <% if debate.active? %>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral"><%= Debate::PHASE_LABELS.fetch(debate.current_phase) %></span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 flex-1 min-w-0">
      <%= render "ui/avatar", user: debate.opponent, size: :md, variant: :tile %>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-ink truncate">@<%= debate.opponent.username %></span>
      <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-disagree">Opponent</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>
